1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,897
Five things you must never do in Bhutan.

2
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:07,533
Don't smoke in public or near religious sites.

3
00:00:07,583 --> 00:00:11,168
Foreigners who sell tobacco can be charged with smuggling.

4
00:00:12,218 --> 00:00:15,308
Don't take photos inside temples or sacred rooms.

5
00:00:15,358 --> 00:00:16,654
Ask your guide first.

6
00:00:17,704 --> 00:00:20,284
Don't litter, and don't harm protected animals.

7
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:24,088
Littering is illegal, and hurting protected species can mean prison.

8
00:00:25,138 --> 00:00:26,398
Don't take antiques home.

9
00:00:26,448 --> 00:00:28,808
It is illegal to take them out of the country.

10
00:00:29,858 --> 00:00:31,602
And don't try to climb a mountain.

11
00:00:31,652 --> 00:00:33,449
Mountaineering is banned in Bhutan.

